  "text": "MDINDEX CODEBASE ARCHITECTURE UNDERSTANDING\n\n### 1. INGESTION PIPELINE (idx.ingest.pipelines)\n- **Main class**: IngestPipeline\n- **Location**: /src/idx/ingest/pipelines.py (372 lines)\n- **Flow**:\n  1. TextNormalizerTransform - normalizes whitespace, BOM\n  2. PersistenceTransform - upserts to documents table + documents_fts\n  3. MarkdownNodeParser - splits into chunks (TextNodes)\n  4. ChunkPersistenceTransform - upserts chunks to chunks_fts table\n  5. [NEW] Embedding computation (planned)\n  6. [NEW] Vector store insertion (planned)\n\n- **Key Features**:\n  - Uses LlamaIndex IngestionPipeline as foundation\n  - Lazy initialization of embed_model and vector_store_manager\n  - Configurable with enable_vector_indexing flag (currently in IngestDirectoryConfig/IngestObsidianConfig)\n  - Statistics tracking via IngestResult\n  - Uses ambient session context (contextvars) for database operations\n\n### 2. CONFIGURATION (idx.core.settings)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/core/settings.py (192 lines)\n- **Key Settings**:\n  - database_path: SQLite db location (~/.idx/idx.db)\n  - vector_store_path: LlamaIndex persist dir (~/.idx/vector_store)\n  - embedding_model: \"BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5\" (HuggingFace)\n  - transformers_model: \"cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2\"\n  - performance.embedding_batch_size: 32\n  - performance.chunk_max_bytes: 2048\n  - performance.chunk_min_bytes: 128\n  \n- **Note**: No enable_vector_indexing in Settings yet - currently in IngestDirectoryConfig/IngestObsidianConfig\n\n### 3. VECTOR STORE (idx.store.vector)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/store/vector.py (298 lines)\n- **Class**: VectorStoreManager\n- **Current Implementation**:\n  - Uses LlamaIndex SimpleVectorStore + StorageContext\n  - Lazy loads/creates index on first use\n  - Uses HuggingFaceEmbedding (configurable model)\n  - Persistence via StorageContext.persist(persist_dir)\n  - Methods: load_or_create(), insert_nodes(), delete_nodes(), delete_ref_doc(), get_retriever()\n  - Embedding batch size from settings\n\n### 4. VECTOR SEARCH (idx.search.vector)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/search/vector.py (199 lines)\n- **Class**: VectorSearch\n- **Features**:\n  - Lazy-loads index via VectorStoreManager\n  - Converts LlamaIndex NodeWithScore to internal SearchResult format\n  - Supports dataset filtering via metadata filters (CONTAINS on source_doc_id)\n  - Returns SearchResult with scores[\"vector\"] containing similarity score\n\n### 5. TRANSFORM MODULE (idx.transform)\n- **Files**:\n  - llama.py (833 lines) - TransformComponent wrappers\n  - chunker.py (274 lines) - LineChunker (deterministic, line-oriented)\n  - normalize.py (362 lines) - TextNormalizer\n  - ontology.py (34 lines)\n\n- **Key Transforms**:\n  - TextNormalizerTransform: Normalizes text (BOM, line endings, whitespace)\n  - PersistenceTransform: Persists documents to DB + FTS\n  - ChunkPersistenceTransform: Persists chunks to chunks_fts table\n  - FTSIndexerTransform: (NotImplemented) Would update FTS index\n\n- **Chunker Details**:\n  - LineChunker: Line-oriented, preserves byte offsets\n  - max_bytes: 1000, min_chunk_size: 100\n  - Returns Chunk objects with seq, pos, text, size\n\n### 6. PERSISTENCE & DATABASE (idx.store)\n- **Files**:\n  - database.py (132 lines) - SQLAlchemy engine/session\n  - models.py (140 lines) - ORM: Dataset, Document\n  - repositories.py (407 lines) - DocumentRepository, DatasetService\n  - fts.py (308 lines) - FTS5 management\n  - fts_chunk.py (316 lines) - Chunk-level FTS (separate table)\n  - session_context.py (116 lines) - Ambient session via contextvars\n  - schemas.py (103 lines) - Pydantic models\n\n- **Database Schema**:\n  - datasets: id, name, uri, source_type, source_path, created_at, updated_at\n  - documents: id, dataset_id, path, active, content_hash, etag, last_modified, body, metadata_json, created_at, updated_at\n  - documents_fts: Virtual FTS5 table (path, body)\n  - chunks_fts: Virtual FTS5 table for chunk-level search\n\n- **Session Context**:\n  - Uses ContextVar for thread-safe ambient session\n  - use_session() context manager for setting ambient session\n  - current_session() to access ambient session\n\n### 7. INGESTION CONFIGURATION (idx.ingest.schemas)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/ingest/schemas.py (130 lines)\n- **Config Classes**:\n  - IngestDirectoryConfig:\n    - source_path, dataset_name, patterns, encoding, force\n    - enable_vector_indexing (DEFAULT: False)\n  - IngestObsidianConfig:\n    - source_path, dataset_name, force\n    - enable_vector_indexing (DEFAULT: False)\n\n### 8. SEARCH SERVICE (idx.search.service)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/search/service.py (388 lines)\n- **Class**: SearchService\n- **Features**:\n  - Unified entry point for FTS, vector, and hybrid search\n  - Lazy-loads retrievers and reranker\n  - Supports SearchCriteria with mode: \"fts\", \"vector\", \"hybrid\"\n  - Optional reranking via Reranker\n\n### 9. HYBRID SEARCH (idx.search.hybrid)\n- **Location**: /src/idx/search/hybrid.py\n- **Features**:\n  - Combines FTS5 (lexical) + vector (semantic) via QueryFusionRetriever\n  - Uses Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) for score combination\n  - Chunk-level search\n\n```\nIngestPipeline.ingest(config)\n├── Create/Get Dataset\n├── Build LlamaIndex IngestionPipeline:\n│   ├── TextNormalizerTransform\n│   ├── PersistenceTransform → documents table + documents_fts\n│   ├── MarkdownNodeParser\n│   └── ChunkPersistenceTransform → chunks_fts table\n├── Load cached pipeline (if exists)\n├── Run pipeline.run(documents)\n│   └── Returns TextNodes (chunks)\n├── [OPTIONAL] IF enable_vector_indexing:\n│   ├── Compute embeddings (HuggingFaceEmbedding)\n│   ├── Insert into vector store (VectorStoreManager)\n│   └── Persist vector store\n└── Return IngestResult with stats\n```\n\n1. **Ambient Session**: Uses contextvars for thread-safe session management\n   - Avoids passing session through multiple layers\n   - Used in: PersistenceTransform, ChunkPersistenceTransform, FTSManager, etc.\n\n2. **Lazy Initialization**: \n   - _embed_model, _vector_store_manager in IngestPipeline\n   - _index in VectorStoreManager, VectorSearch\n   - Retrievers in SearchService\n\n3. **Transform Chain**: LlamaIndex IngestionPipeline orchestrates multiple transforms\n   - Each transform is stateless (mostly)\n   - Transforms modify nodes in-place and pass through\n\n4. **Dual Persistence**:\n   - SQLAlchemy for documents/metadata (SQLite)\n   - LlamaIndex StorageContext for vector store (JSON files)\n   - FTS5 virtual tables integrated with SQLite\n\n5. **Metadata-Driven Filtering**:\n   - source_doc_id format: \"{dataset_name}:{path}\"\n   - Used for dataset filtering in vector search\n\n- Total: ~9,927 lines across idx package\n- Largest modules: transform/llama.py (833), store/docstore.py (589), store/dataset.py (524)\n- Pipeline: ingest/pipelines.py (372)\n- Vector: store/vector.py (298), search/vector.py (199)",
